      body("We reviewed Heron Med Spa's full market presence, including your website, reviews, social media, online directories, booking experience, and 17 competitors actively targeting your patients right now in the Alexandria and greater DC area. What follows is a summary of what we found and exactly how The Luxora Collective helps practices like yours close these gaps in 90 days or less.", { before: 60, after: 60 }),

